#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:86
#: 4bbf1a3719a14e8aabeadf2904a661b2
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:88
#: f49e52ecbfdf459ebab3f8fdcadaf390
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and"
" normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling "
"Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be "
"configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups "
"that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal "
"servo/motor output) are: 1/2, 3/4/8, 5/6/7, 8, and 9 (LED)."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。但在同一输出组内，DShot 与普通 PWM 不可混用，即若某组中的一个输出启用了 "
"DShot，该组中的所有输出均须配置为 DShot，而非 PWM 输出。必须保持相同模式（PWM 频率或 "
"DShot）的输出组为：1/2、3/4/8、5/6/7、8 以及 9（LED）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:90
#: 3bc8f71dee5045698f2212d9c58e9b01
msgid "PWM9 is marked as \"LED\""
msgstr "PWM9 标记为「LED」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:93
#: e930e578cae8421d8851abb10888fa1d
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:95
#: 9cb843997afd47718caba9bf24150c95
msgid ""
"The SBUS pin, is passed by an inverter to RX2 (UART2 RX), which by default "
"is mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used for all "
"ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 引脚经反相器接至 RX2（UART2 RX），默认映射为定时器输入而非 UART，支持 ArduPilot 所有接收机协议，但需要真实 "
"UART 连接的 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外。通过此方式连接时，FPort 可提供 RC 信号但无数传回传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:97
#: fef554a02436470982e2cbf5ebc35770
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the RX2 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART2 RX "
"pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL7 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"为支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机的嵌入式数传，可将 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` "
"设为「1」，使 RX2 引脚配置为真实的 UART2 RX 引脚，成为 SERIAL7 端口的 RX 输入，以支持双向系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:99
#: 9512a2562382405498734ee5e50835af
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 须设为「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:101
#: a07c4f410fa142c5a398ae0f445ef6be
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:103
#: 63e1a2ee246d4896bced93abbff59744
msgid ""
"DSM/SRXL connects to the RX2  pin, but SBUS would still be connected to "
"SBUS."
msgstr "DSM/SRXL 连接至 RX2 引脚，SBUS 仍连接至 SBUS 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:105
#: 8ee5586dc5bd48deac6ecedc4fc100fd
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX2 and RX2 via a bi-directional inverter. See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向电平转换器连接至 TX2 和 RX2。请参阅 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:107
#: 2921c1cbb57b4d14b52995ee76a99192
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to RX2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除需要 RX2 外还需要 TX2 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:109
#: f39ed3b0417b440aae069044262eab7e
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接至 TX2 并自动提供数传回传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:111
#: e4d8b3cc9046413194229c0d656ab8c6
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion "
"on other UARTs). See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""
"任意 UART 也可用于 ArduPilot 中的 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议（SBUS 在其他 UART "
"上需要外部反相器）。详情参见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-atomrcf405-navi.rst:113
#: 00549a8b06124424a461df70829ee678
msgid ""
"the 5v pin above the SBUS pin and the 5V pin in the GPS connector are "
"powered when USB is connected. All other 5V pins are only powered when "
"battery is present."
msgstr "SBUS 引脚上方的 5V 引脚以及 GPS 连接器上的 5V 引脚在 USB 连接时即上电。其他所有 5V 引脚仅在电池接入时上电。"

